                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "OpenStreetMap"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " as a boundary-data publisher — the ten exact administrative relation versions used by NYC Boundaries: one county-level and one borough-level relation for each of the five NYC counties. For how these relations compare against DCP, the Census Bureau, NYS Civil Boundaries, and other independently governed sources, see "
