                    "text": "Each relation's version number, edit timestamp, administrative tags, and identifiers were retrieved directly from the OpenStreetMap API (version 0.6) and cross-checked against the governed assertion records; this page does not independently verify OSM's underlying geometry. For independent cross-source verification of these relations, see "
