                    ],
                    "description": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "OpenStreetMap's own published relation versions, as OpenStreetMap contributors edited them — not an independent recomputation. Confidence is Moderate rather than High because OSM is a crowd-sourced, continuously editable map, not a single authoritative publisher."
